{"id":"tragique","lemma":"tragique","pos":"adj","rank":2848,"glosses":["tragic"],"ipa":"/tʁa.ʒik/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7b/Fr-tragique.ogg/Fr-tragique.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"tragiques"},"examples":[{"text":"C'était un accident tragique.","en":"It was a tragic accident.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"accident"},null]},{"text":"C'est si tragique.","en":"That's so tragic.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"if, whether"},null]},{"text":"C'est tragique !","en":"How tragic!","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Comme c'est tragique !","en":"How tragic!","words":[{"g":"as"},{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Après qu'il eut entendu la tragique nouvelle, il sortit dehors pour être seul.","en":"After hearing the tragic news, he went outside to be alone.","words":[{"g":"after"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to hear","l":"entendre"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"news"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to exit","l":"sortir"},{"g":"outside"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"alone"}]}]}